# 📊 Naukri Job Analytics Platform

A complete end-to-end job market analytics platform built using Python, Selenium, SQLite, Streamlit, and Machine Learning.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Multi-keyword Naukri job scraping
- Automated multi-page scraping
- SQLite database storage
- Interactive Streamlit dashboard
- Resume Matcher AI
- Skills analysis
- Hiring trend analytics
- Clickable job application links
- Real-time filtering and search

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- Python
- Selenium
- Pandas
- SQLite
- Streamlit
- Plotly
- Scikit-learn
- PyPDF2

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```bash
naukri_scraper_project/
```

---

## ▶ Run Scraper

```bash
python main.py
```

---

## ▶ Run Dashboard

```bash
streamlit run dashboard/app.py
```

---

## 📈 Dashboard Features

- KPI cards
- Job trend analytics
- Skill analysis
- Resume-job matching
- Interactive charts
- Downloadable datasets

---

## 🤖 Resume Matcher AI

Upload your resume PDF and get:
- Job match percentage
- Top matching jobs
- Direct application links

