# AI-Powered Job Analytics Platform

## Features
- Multi-source job scraping
- Naukri integration
- Greenhouse ATS integration
- Lever ATS integration
- Streamlit dashboard
- Resume matching
- SQLite database
- Automated scheduler
- Job analytics

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Selenium
- Pandas
- SQLite
- Streamlit
- Plotly

## Architecture
Scraper → Database → Analytics Dashboard

## How to Run

### Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

### Run scraper
python main.py

### Run dashboard
streamlit run dashboard/app.py

### Run scheduler
python scheduler.py